diff --git a/UPGRADING.md b/UPGRADING.md
index 2edfb2c4eb8..8afe02b115e 100644
--- a/UPGRADING.md
+++ b/UPGRADING.md
@@ -12,6 +12,12 @@ The format of this change log follows the advice given at [Keep a CHANGELOG](htt
 
 #### Added
 
+- `csv_export_writer` has a new method `set_escape_formulas(bool)` and `csv_export_writer::print_array()` a new optional
+  `$escapeformulas` parameter (default `true`) to control whether values that could be interpreted as spreadsheet formulas
+  are escaped. `csv_import_reader::load_csv_content()` no longer escapes formulas when storing imported data, so values
+  such as passwords starting with `@`, `=`, `+` or `-` are imported unchanged.
+
+  For more information see [MDL-87794](https://tracker.moodle.org/browse/MDL-87794)
 - `email_to_user()` now emits a hook `before_email_to_user`. This hook allows any subscriber to modify the email contents, add additional headers, or add reasons to block the email. If any block reasons are added, the email is stopped from being sent and the reasons are output.
 
   For more information see [MDL-69724](https://tracker.moodle.org/browse/MDL-69724)
